# Build output.
dist/

# Synced copies of the pipeline's data, written by scripts/sync_data.ts before
# every dev and build. Never committed, for two reasons:
#
#   They are copies. The originals live in recovery-bench/data/ and are the
#   record; a second copy in git is a second thing to drift.
#
#   One of them is sweep_rows.jsonl, which is deliberately gitignored at the
#   repository root as per-run experimental output. Committing it here would
#   smuggle it back in through the side door and make a fresh clone look as
#   though a sweep had already run on it.
public/
